    <string name="settings_scope_title">Access Restriction, Not UI Modification</string>
    <string name="settings_scope_body">Android does not permit external apps to strip or hide buttons inside third-party applications. VOID prioritizes reliable access restriction by detecting Reels and Shorts views the moment they open and redirecting you back—preserving normal feeds, stories, messages, profiles, subscriptions, search, and regular videos.</string>
